sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PN as PhysioNet<br/>(Apnea-ECG, UCD)
    participant TR as Model training<br/>(offline)
    participant SEED as Seed script
    participant CFG as clinical_rules.yaml
    participant SIM as device-simulator
    participant CS as carbon-scheduler
    participant ETCD as etcd
    participant K as Kafka
    participant DET as apnea-detector<br/>(+ CodeCarbon)
    participant TRI as ahi-triage
    participant ALS as alert-service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant DASH as doctor-dashboard
    actor DOC as Dr. Demo
    participant MON as Prometheus + Grafana

    %% ---------- PURPLE: hardcoded / simulated setup ----------
    rect rgb(232, 222, 255)
    Note over SEED,DB: 🟣 Setup – hardcoded / simulated data
    SEED->>DB: Patient master data P001–P005 (age, sex, BMI) + device IDs
    SEED->>DB: User "Dr. Demo" (no login)
    CFG-->>DET: Clinical rules: apnea = SpO₂ drop ≥ 3 %, alert = SpO₂ below 80 %
    CFG-->>TRI: AHI thresholds 5 / 15 / 30, deadline 08:00 (simulated clock)
    SIM->>TR: Synthetic night signals + apnea labels (ground truth for training)
    end

    %% ---------- YELLOW: optional external data ----------
    rect rgb(255, 244, 196)
    Note over PN,TR: 🟡 Optional – external data
    PN->>TR: Apnea-ECG: ECG + expert apnea label per minute (WFDB)
    PN->>TR: UCD: real nights with SpO₂ + airflow (unseen test data)
    TR->>TR: Compare fast vs. accurate model (F1)
    TR-->>DET: Trained accurate model file
    end

    %% ---------- PURPLE -> GREEN: carbon ----------
    rect rgb(232, 222, 255)
    Note over CS: 🟣 Simulated carbon data
    CS->>CS: Read carbon intensity (gCO₂/kWh) + price per hour per region (CSV or button)
    end
    rect rgb(214, 244, 214)
    Note over CS,ETCD: 🟢 Generated – carbon mode
    CS->>ETCD: PUT carbon_mode = green / dirty
    end

    %% ---------- PURPLE: night streaming ----------
    rect rgb(232, 222, 255)
    Note over SIM,K: 🟣 Simulated night (8 h ≈ 2 min)
    SIM->>K: Device / night metadata (patient, night, device, start and stop time)
    loop every simulated minute
        SIM->>K: SpO₂ + breathing sample (+ apnea label)
    end
    end

    %% ---------- GREEN: generated by the system ----------
    rect rgb(214, 244, 214)
    Note over K,DB: 🟢 Generated by the system
    K->>DET: Consume minute samples
    DET->>DET: Clean signals (missing values, noise)
    DET->>DB: Raw night archive → raw_nights (one row per night)

    opt SpO₂ below 80 % (never delayed)
        DET-)ALS: Alert over ZeroMQ (patient, time, value)
        ALS->>DB: INSERT alerts (acknowledged = no)
        DASH->>DB: Read new alerts
        DASH-->>DOC: Show alert within 5 s
    end

    DET->>ETCD: GET carbon_mode
    alt dirty electricity
        Note over K,DET: Night waits in Kafka for a greener window (always before 08:00)
        CS->>DET: Move detector pod to greener node (AT / NO / PL)
        DET->>DET: Fast rule-based model
    else green electricity
        DET->>DET: Accurate scikit-learn model
    end

    DET->>K: Detected apnea events per minute
    K->>TRI: Consume events
    TRI->>TRI: AHI = events / hours of sleep → normal / mild / moderate / severe
    TRI->>DB: INSERT results (AHI, category, events, model used)

    DET->>MON: Energy measurements: kWh + gCO₂ per model run (CodeCarbon)
    MON->>MON: System metrics: latency, Kafka lag, pods, CPU/RAM, model used, events found
    end

    %% ---------- GREEN: doctor decisions ----------
    rect rgb(214, 244, 214)
    Note over DASH,DOC: 🟢 Generated – doctor decisions + audit log
    DOC->>DASH: Open dashboard
    DASH->>DB: Read results (sorted by severity) + alerts
    DASH->>DB: Read raw_nights for SpO₂ chart
    DASH-->>DOC: Report: AHI, category, events, SpO₂ chart
    DOC->>DASH: Approve or correct result
    DASH->>DB: INSERT decisions + audit_log (who, what, when)
    end
